OL,3,GNEWSA'We didn't know a cold sore could
OL,4,Akill a baby'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved mother whose newborn
OL,7,Fdaughter died after contracting the
OL,8,Fherpes simplex virus (HSV) is urging
OL,9,Fother parents to learn about the
OL,10,Flittle-known dangers cold sores can
OL,11,Fpose to babies.
OL,13,FFor most adults, cold sores are usually
OL,14,Fa painful but common infection. But in
OL,15,Fnewborn babies, whose immune systems
OL,16,Fare not yet fully developed, HSV can
OL,17,Fcause a life-threatening illness.
OL,19,FMeg Edmonds' daughter Magnolia died
OL,20,Faged just 10 days in February and it is
OL,21,Fsuspected the virus may have been
OL,22,Fpassed on by her mother.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
