OL,3,GNEWSA'We didn't know a cold sore could
OL,4,Akill a baby'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The guilt is obviously unbearable,
OL,7,Fit's horrific, but I just try and
OL,8,Fremind myself that I didn't know and I
OL,9,Fdid what I could have done with the
OL,10,Fknowledge that I did have," she said.
